\newlabel{fig:scatter_and_oracle}{{3}{4}{(Left) CAR inflation from action collapse. Solid dots: reported CAR; hollow dots: dfCAR. The gap (red lines) quantifies illusory safety; Pi0-family models show 82--91\,pp inflation. (Right) CAR for oracle SDF refinement versus unrefined baselines. All GT oracle variants underperform despite perfect distance information}{figure.3}{}}
